f Assumption University. Applicants with a PhD in Criminology, Criminal Justice, Sociology (with a demonstrated concentration in Criminology or Criminal Justice) or a related field are preferred. ABD graduate students with prior teaching experience will also be considered, as will those with a terminal master’s degree in Criminology or a related field and prior teaching experience."
